OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dreary day, being overcast
OL,6,Fwith spells of light rain for many.
OL,7,FThough it will remain dry for some,
OL,8,Fthe rain may be persistent at times in
OL,9,Fthe afternoon. Feeling chilly with a
OL,10,Flight, cool breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud and rain to continue
OL,13,Finto the night for northern parts, but
OL,14,Fwhere skies gradually clear in the
OL,15,Fsouth, areas of fog may develop.
OL,16,FFeeling cold, particularly under clear
OL,17,Fspells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
