OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FAny areas of fog will lift
OL,6,Fthrough the morning. From then, a dry
OL,7,Fbut cloudy day is expected, with the
OL,8,Foccasional break to brighter skies.
OL,9,FAnother chilly autumn day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFoggy
OL,12,Fand frosty mornings for Sunday and
OL,13,FMonday, then becoming crisp and sunny
OL,14,Fautumn days. Becoming cloudy on Monday
OL,15,Fevening ahead of overnight rain.
OL,16,FMilder, wetter and windier on Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
